    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >1-4 PLAYERS:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this top-down, turn-based resource strategy game, you and fellow pioneers set out to start your own towns in a newly discovered region. Be the first to dominate the land and lay claim to the entire area.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HOW TO WIN:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531790/extras/ce63521b084e9ae46a732e7e8978ca74.webp?t=1741885346\" width=497 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531790/extras/a8b27ea720ea3ea8eff297ca0e061ac1.poster.avif?t=1741885346\" width=608 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531790/extras/a8b27ea720ea3ea8eff297ca0e061ac1.webm?t=1741885346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531790/extras/a8b27ea720ea3ea8eff297ca0e061ac1.mp4?t=1741885346\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531790/extras/d2c4c65f7964f24d49931139a8dbd549.webp?t=1741885346\" width=134 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531790/extras/8fdce00d110405ebdca299861610b6c9.avif?t=1741885346\" width=608 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531790/extras/77cdccd124edeeadd8653e086aa9af61.webp?t=1741885346\" wid